<<~ ahu #/head>>

! New Delos ~ Places Index

''The fractal worksheet law:'' the Realm-hex worksheet
([[region-worksheet|../region-worksheet.md]]) holds the 30-mile view; each named Destination
earns a Travel-hex place meme on this shelf; Sites and Areas that matter (extraction, delving,
RSS profiles) nest beneath their Destinations. ''Every place meme declares its stratum and its
hex-scale.'' Feed every hex: horizon · hidden handle · bleed.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/roster>>

!! The Destination Roster

''High Delos (the constellation):'' the House of Masks (Theatre Quarter) · the High Delos
Archive · the Orrery · the Naxian Colossus precinct (the civic ley-line node) · the Terrace of
the Lions · //further sky-hubs unnamed//.

''The sea-level ring (young ports, founded post-flight):'' the Salt-Stair's harbor town
(''town unnamed — prompt'') · the Spice Quarter and its market district · //three-to-five
ring-ports await naming//.

''Below:'' the Low Delos mouth (where Rinia rose), towns to the third level.

''Far exclaves of the constellation:'' the Poseidon-coast crags · the Artemision's risen six
miles (near the Izmir-coast) — constellation members hanging over other Realms.

''Elsewhere-but-adjacent:'' Hawaiki, the drifting Nexus, moors on its own unwritten rhythm.

<<~/ahu>>

